<description>&lt;b&gt;SUB-D Connectors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Harting&lt;br&gt;
NorComp&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
PREFIX :&lt;br&gt;
H = High density&lt;br&gt;
F = Female&lt;br&gt;
M = Male&lt;p&gt;
